WEBVTT

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:19.490
This is Tango team!

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:21.370
We’re engaged in battle on Level B3!

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:22.330
I can’t see them!

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:23.740
This is…

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:24.330
Backup!

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:25.670
We need backup—

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:26.410
Tango team!

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:27.400
Come in!

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:28.130
Hey!

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:29.490
You’ve got to be kidding me.

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:30.960
I’m the only one left?

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:39.760
Your mission is to take control of this underground facility,

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:42.500
and then retrieve the artifacts without damaging them.

00:00:43.030 --> 00:00:46.270
Next year, when you turn seventeen,

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:48.130
you will follow the old covenant

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:50.260
and serve Her Royal Highness,

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:52.510
where you will perform your duties as her close servant.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:57.530
This mission shall be the test to determine if you are ready.

00:00:57.970 --> 00:00:59.280
Use everything that you have.

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:06.500
What in the world is this place?

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:17.150
Princess?

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:20.720
It couldn’t be…

00:01:21.170 --> 00:01:22.720
Are they all…?

00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:27.290
You saw them?

00:01:27.290 --> 00:01:29.190
You poor child…

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:38.020
I will kill you.

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:40.910
I will kill you.

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:32.570
With that…

00:02:32.570 --> 00:02:35.350
She and I are the only ones left.

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:44.890
Onii-chan sounds like he’s suffering.

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:46.350
Does it still hurt?

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:49.420
He must be dreaming about something painful.

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:00.700
I’m off…

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:01.950
…Princess.

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:12.170
Thanks.

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:17.550
These kids kept insisting that they had to save Her Highness’ knight.

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:20.770
Well… that’s because Mama is a nurse.

00:03:21.620 --> 00:03:25.730
I work in the medical department of the government.

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:29.730
So werewolves drop by for treatment from time to time.

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:31.480
Hey, Onii-chan…

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:33.770
Her Highness is fine, right?

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:35.280
You’d better save her!

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:39.420
Three hours until dawn…

00:03:40.390 --> 00:03:42.790
Princess, you’re…

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:49.080
During that mission one year ago,

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.630
you saw a certain something.

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:55.670
A grave secret about the Pure One’s inheritance…

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:58.300
Onii-chan?

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:02.970
I’ll be off now.

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:04.560
It’s almost dawn.

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:05.560
This way!

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:10.820
They’re…

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:20.440
All of these people are the Fangless who reside here in the Bund.

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:21.910
Here, take this.

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:23.580
Eat it when you’re hungry.

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:25.370
Be careful.

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:26.790
Don’t die!

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:30.750
And they were all given hope by Her Highness.

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:31.500
Good luck!

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:32.490
Don’t lose!
Good luck!

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:33.050
You’d better make it back alive!
Don’t lose!

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:33.750
You’d better make it back alive!

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.260
For Her Highness’ sake.

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:38.030
Choosing to lose our fangs,

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:39.850
and preventing ourselves from harming humans,

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:41.600
meant choosing to become alone.

00:04:41.950 --> 00:04:43.780
That was inevitable.

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:46.590
Since we had become neither vampire nor human…

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:48.350
it was a fate we had come to accept.

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:53.090
But the first thing Her Highness did after establishing the Bund,

00:04:53.090 --> 00:04:58.110
was to bring all of the Fangless in the world here, created families out of us,

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:02.160
and that act gave us something to live for once again.

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:05.910
Her Highness is our savior.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:13.920
Onii-chan?

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:16.420
I’ll definitely…

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:17.670
I’ll definitely make it back…

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:20.220
…to the Princess’ side!

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:23.890
This…

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:27.470
This is what the Princess had built.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:34.870
This is what she has been trying to protect!

00:05:36.220 --> 00:05:37.850
I’m going!

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:43.570
Your body should still be under the effect of cellular transformation inhibitors.

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:45.080
Please be careful.

00:05:53.930 --> 00:05:55.680
Let me hear it.

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:58.920
What is the “Pure One’s inheritance” that those three mentioned?

00:06:00.450 --> 00:06:02.380
Do not think you can feign ignorance.

00:06:03.010 --> 00:06:06.430
Due to lack of information on our end,

00:06:06.430 --> 00:06:09.350
we had hesitated to inform you of it…

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:10.350
Wolf.

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:14.190
But I do not believe we can hide this matter any longer.

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:28.790
Hey, why does it have to be you?

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:32.870
Cellular transformation inhibitors.

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:39.380
Before performing surgery, they’re injected into beastmen to lower their cellular activity.

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:41.470
It takes three hours to take full effect.

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:45.810
The only thing I ate before this ridiculous game of tag began,

00:06:45.810 --> 00:06:47.810
was that stupid candy of yours!

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:52.070
Why?

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:53.870
Please, tell me.

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:55.940
Why does it have to be you?!

00:06:56.570 --> 00:06:58.150
You see…

00:06:58.150 --> 00:06:59.730
I’ve waited a long time for this moment.

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:05.990
The moment when Mina Țepeș and The Three Clans converged in one place.

00:07:05.990 --> 00:07:08.620
The right moment to turn everything to dust.

00:07:09.850 --> 00:07:12.500
All for the sake of my one and only.

00:07:13.340 --> 00:07:16.000
I’ll tell you this beforehand: it isn’t for Rozenmann.

00:07:16.440 --> 00:07:19.670
That girl in the other castle who looked exactly like the Princess?

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:23.630
Your memories have returned, huh?

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:26.960
During his mission a year ago,

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:29.640
Akira saw a small portion of the inheritance.

00:07:29.640 --> 00:07:34.090
The reason he lost his memories from heavy, but non-critical injuries…

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:37.150
…was most likely an attempt to seal away what he had seen.

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:38.000
Why?

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:40.940
Is it something so difficult to accept?

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:43.860
Only Akira would know the details.

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:49.290
One thing we do know is that it was something the Pure One left behind.

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:52.230
That should also be the case with the Three Clans as well.

00:07:52.230 --> 00:07:56.330
They simply believe that the inheritance is the Pure One’s blood.

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:58.210
The Pure One’s blood?

00:07:58.210 --> 00:08:01.330
We vampires are a species whose progression has frozen.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:04.240
Forsaken by evolution, we are merely at a standstill,

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:06.010
waiting to be reduced to ashes.

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:10.640
But with the Pure One’s inheritance, time will begin to flow once more,

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:12.720
guiding vampires into the future.

00:08:17.060 --> 00:08:18.270
Just as I thought…

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:20.810
You’re the one who attacked me back then.

00:08:21.820 --> 00:08:24.070
Who was that?

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:27.760
That person gave me a reason to live.

00:08:27.760 --> 00:08:31.800
Like me, she was oppressed, and her existence was erased from all records.

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:33.950
And yet, she still tries to live strong.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:35.330
She’s my Princess.

00:08:41.630 --> 00:08:43.800
Come with me, Meiren.

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:47.000
It’s your name.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:48.380
Isn’t it beautiful?

00:08:49.640 --> 00:08:53.460
She gave me everything I needed.

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:58.390
When I was nothing more than an endangered member of the Forest Clan,

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:01.520
she gave me a name, freedom, and a meaning to live.

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:04.160
I’m willing to put my life on the line…

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:06.690
…just to open the door to a new world.

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:11.480
And I will make her the ruler of all humans, vampires, and any other life forms…

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:13.900
…as the Queen of the new world that I will create.

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:16.660
Meiren, you’re…

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:19.410
…Telomere?

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:24.660
So you were responsible for everything that’s happened.

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:28.750
I can’t allow you to have the Pure One’s inheritance.

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:33.300
By “inheritance,” do you mean those countless likenesses of the Princess?

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:36.300
Or do you mean that blood-like substance?

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:39.300
Both… is probably the answer.

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:42.630
We need both to attain the future.

00:09:42.630 --> 00:09:44.810
Both the Pure One’s blood, and…

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:48.690
Your Princess or mine…

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:50.690
Which one will it be?

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:04.700
Hey, aren’t you worried?

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:07.790
After seeing so many likenesses of Mina back there,

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:12.410
aren’t you worried that your precious Princess is only one of many?

00:10:21.610 --> 00:10:22.470
That’s just…

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:23.970
Nothing but a joke.

00:10:25.210 --> 00:10:28.150
Take Gilgamesh or Qin Shi Huang as examples.

00:10:28.150 --> 00:10:31.530
All of those in power will ultimately do the exactly same thing:

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:35.160
Namely, embark on a treasure hunt to extend their own lifespans.

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:36.770
What a disappointment.

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:37.570
Your Majesty…

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:39.760
What a fool I have made of myself.

00:10:39.760 --> 00:10:42.320
I was deceived by the mere mention of “inheritance.”

00:10:42.760 --> 00:10:44.590
No matter what it is,

00:10:44.590 --> 00:10:47.140
so long as Akira made a promise to me,

00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:50.120
it will never end up falling into their hands.

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:54.880
Didn’t you say…

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:58.300
…that we’re the only ones who can understand each other?

00:10:59.150 --> 00:11:01.470
We are indeed alike in many ways.

00:11:02.020 --> 00:11:03.690
So you should also understand this:

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:05.690
The Princess I made my promise to…

00:11:05.690 --> 00:11:07.060
…is my one and only Princess.

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:10.830
Say, Akira…

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:13.050
To love someone must mean…

00:11:13.050 --> 00:11:14.730
…you’re crazy for that person, don’t you think?

00:11:15.670 --> 00:11:18.490
Yes, both you and I…

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:19.740
…are out of our minds.

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:23.270
We’re butterflies who have fallen for flowers,

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:26.240
willing to offer our hearts, bodies, and everything we have…

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:27.490
…without any regrets.

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:33.540
What if I pull out an altered vial of the Blood of Agni…

00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:35.420
…which reacts to beastmen’s blood?

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:38.260
You wouldn’t…

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:40.590
Don’t worry. I won’t die alone.

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:44.890
This will only blow up right in front of your Princess.

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:48.060
Now…

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:50.180
Let’s have our last dance.

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:51.930
Will it be your Princess?

00:11:51.930 --> 00:11:53.350
Or will it be mine?

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:56.180
Let’s dance for the true queen who will seize the future.

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:07.370
I actually kind of liked you… you know?

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:35.270
The sun is rising…

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:47.410
Akira-kun!

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:52.500
Akira!

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:54.500
That’s the only one left alive?

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:55.750
How?

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:59.500
This is the ultimate show.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:02.050
Wouldn’t you say so, Your Majesty?

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:35.120
NO!

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:45.170
This is the end, Akira.

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:48.180
It’s no use. Dammit!

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:49.680
Akira-san…

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:52.970
No, please don’t…

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:54.220
Do not look away!

00:13:55.990 --> 00:13:57.770
Akira said he would win.

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:00.770
He said he would return to me.

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:05.780
And he will never break that promise, even if it kills him.

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:07.930
Rise, Akira.

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:09.280
I am here!

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:12.250
Your Mina is right here.

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:17.660
Princess…

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:23.400
Sorry…

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:26.970
Looks like… I made you cry again.

00:14:31.490 --> 00:14:33.140
Just wait…

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:35.220
I’m… coming.

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:40.350
Hey, Akira.

00:14:41.030 --> 00:14:42.860
Why weren’t our Princesses…

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:47.140
…the same one?

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:14.900
It’s… your victory…

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:21.350
But… I’m kind of happy.

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:27.880
I never thought… I would die in someone’s arms.

00:15:38.430 --> 00:15:39.330
Akira-kun!

00:15:39.780 --> 00:15:40.750
How?!

00:15:42.840 --> 00:15:44.130
The match seems to be over.

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:46.510
I don’t approve!

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:48.880
This was nothing but mere play!

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:50.270
Have you no shame?!

00:15:50.270 --> 00:15:54.260
Are you not a descendant of a branch family of the Pure One?!

00:15:56.740 --> 00:15:58.160
You must be kidding me.

00:15:58.160 --> 00:15:59.440
You ingrate!

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:00.310
Wolf-sama!

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.360
You tricked us!

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:11.320
You little…

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:15.090
But you do not truly believe the lords of The Three Clans…

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:17.580
…will go down from something like this, do you?

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:26.660
Sunlight?

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:27.340
From where?!

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:31.450
The inner walls of this building are threaded with optical fibers.

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:36.180
They are able to absorb sunlight, and then release it at any location in this building.

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:38.030
If we wished,

00:16:38.030 --> 00:16:41.270
we could even have the sun shine down on this very room.

00:16:41.270 --> 00:16:42.890
You’re bluffing.

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:46.100
If you do that, you would also put your master in danger.

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:52.070
I am the Queen,

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:53.780
ruler of half the world.

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:55.610
Queen of the world of darkness.

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:58.240
I have been raised to live as such.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:00.120
I have desired to live as such.

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:02.280
I built up my territory carefully.

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:05.340
But if I must continue to live at your every bidding,

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:08.630
I will gladly allow myself to be reduced to ashes!

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:11.130
Now choose!

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:13.790
Will you perish here with me?

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:15.720
Or will you consider me your Queen and bow down to me?

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:28.480
Thank you for your long service as guardians.

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:32.520
Return to your countries and worry only of ruling your own districts.

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:09.980
Akira!

00:18:12.140 --> 00:18:13.180
Akira!

00:18:13.410 --> 00:18:14.430
Akira!

00:18:14.620 --> 00:18:15.990
Akira!

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:32.750
Please smile…

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:38.760
That’s why I…

00:18:45.550 --> 00:18:47.890
Yeah, that’s my…

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:51.560
That’s… my…

00:18:59.100 --> 00:18:59.740
Three howls…

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:02.790
…in honor of our hero!

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:13.150
I see.

00:19:13.690 --> 00:19:14.790
Thank you.

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:16.880
Rest in peace now…

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:18.460
Meiren.

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:25.830
The one Meiren was serving…

00:19:25.830 --> 00:19:27.850
The one who’s identical to me…

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:29.850
I wonder who she is.

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:31.560
Does it bother you?

00:19:32.010 --> 00:19:35.750
Well… we’re most likely bound to see each other.

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:37.960
She and I, I mean.

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:41.820
And once again, more blood will be shed.

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:44.890
Is your arm all right?

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:45.810
Yeah.

00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:47.880
I’m glad it could be reattached.

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.300
It doesn’t hurt much anymore either.

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:53.080
I see…

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:55.360
But I’m really surprised.

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:58.650
I didn’t know there was a place like this in the least urbanized section of the Bund.

00:19:58.650 --> 00:20:00.590
I call this place the Cradle.

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:05.600
A cradle for anyone alive to escape from the tumults of life…

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:09.100
…and to dream eternally.

00:20:11.570 --> 00:20:12.670
A butterfly?

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:14.400
Akira.

00:20:14.950 --> 00:20:19.940
On that day seven years ago, I made a wish and you made it come true.

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:23.990
This time, it is my turn to listen to your wish.

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:33.210
Stay by my side, Princess.

00:20:34.060 --> 00:20:36.710
Until the day I die,

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:39.460
always be by my side.

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:43.930
I may not be the one and only Queen.

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:45.260
Are you sure that’s what you want?

00:20:46.670 --> 00:20:49.260
But you’re my one and only Princess.

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:53.190
Then I will hereby make an oath.

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:57.500
Until the day one of us falls,

00:20:57.500 --> 00:21:00.280
my life will be one with yours.

00:21:00.850 --> 00:21:06.280
It may only seem like a moment in the length of an eternity,

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:09.030
but this promise will last forever.

00:21:13.020 --> 00:21:14.920
To always be together.

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:16.540
As the boy made the promise,

00:21:16.950 --> 00:21:19.690
the demon queen made one as well.

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:22.520
“I will always be by your side.”

00:21:24.110 --> 00:21:26.050
May I have this dance, Akira?

00:21:26.810 --> 00:21:27.800
Yeah.

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:36.640
And their oath would never be broken.

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:40.030
Yes…

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:43.920
It was kept until the story met its conclusion.

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:54.330
It was a story of an oath.

00:21:54.330 --> 00:22:00.070
A fairy tale about a great demon queen and the young man who devoted everything to her…

00:22:00.070 --> 00:22:03.710
…and the eternal bond that bound them together.

00:22:05.700 --> 00:22:07.030
It’s not here.

00:22:07.030 --> 00:22:09.550
Where did that idiot wolf drop it?

00:22:09.860 --> 00:22:12.370
So now you notice that little trait of his?

00:22:12.370 --> 00:22:14.560
A little, just a little.

00:22:14.840 --> 00:22:16.080
Here it is!

00:22:16.080 --> 00:22:16.780
Where was it?

00:22:16.780 --> 00:22:18.690
Rather, where did you go looking for it?

00:22:18.960 --> 00:22:20.590
Some mice were gnawing on it.

00:22:20.590 --> 00:22:22.300
It’s all mucky now.

00:22:22.300 --> 00:22:25.160
It’s okay. You just need to blow on it.

00:22:25.160 --> 00:22:27.450
It’s not like it was just dropped.

00:22:28.120 --> 00:22:30.450
It looks like you had your arm reattached, right, Akira?

00:22:30.680 --> 00:22:32.950
Yeah, you don’t have to worry anymore.

00:22:32.950 --> 00:22:34.250
You must be grateful.

00:22:34.250 --> 00:22:36.850
The maids searched relentlessly for it.

00:22:36.850 --> 00:22:40.460
Oh? They have a good side.

00:22:42.650 --> 00:22:44.050
Okay, let’s go!

00:22:44.050 --> 00:22:45.720
Nero, quickly!

00:22:45.720 --> 00:22:47.660
Wait for me!

00:22:48.340 --> 00:22:49.470
And… Go!

00:22:49.700 --> 00:22:52.190
Dance with the Vampire Maids!

00:22:52.190 --> 00:22:53.970
Let’s put an end in this!

00:22:53.970 --> 00:22:55.470
See you later!

00:22:55.470 --> 00:22:56.760
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:22:56.760 --> 00:22:58.680
I told you to stop that!

00:22:58.940 --> 00:23:00.980
<b>This is
The End</b>
